   $q$How does the author view the "tidy version" of the story?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It is a complete invention with no basis in the valley's historical records.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstates-claim"},{"text":"It is the best possible account, and the author repeats it only to confirm it.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-viewpoint"},{"text":"It is too complicated for general readers and needs to be simplified.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It is mostly accurate in its facts but misleading in where it places the action.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It is mostly accurate in its facts but misleading in where it places the action.$q$, $q$The author says "Almost every sentence in that version is true" but that it "misleads" by placing "all the action in a company office." The author does not call it invented and wants a fuller story, not a simpler one.$q$, 'draft', 'a10f0fdd-fb91-54a2-8706-60ff47a4f21d')
