   $q$Under side-out scoring, what did the receiving team gain by winning a rally?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It earned only the right to serve, not a point.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It earned a point, but the other team kept serving.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-rules"},{"text":"It earned nothing at all, and the serve stayed put.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"It earned one point and kept the serve as well.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-rules"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It earned only the right to serve, not a point.$q$, $q$Paragraph 1 says the receiving team "earned nothing but the right to serve." So it gained the serve but no point, which rules out the choices that award a point.$q$, 'draft', '8639ec72-9f4f-5284-944c-db11d2789b21')
