   $q$In paragraph 2, the slime mold has a "rudimentary structure." What does "rudimentary" mean?$q$, $q$[{"text":"highly complex","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-meaning"},{"text":"badly damaged","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"basic and undeveloped","is_correct":true},{"text":"rude or impolite","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"surface-association"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$basic and undeveloped$q$, $q$The body is "little more than a single enormous cell" and lacks "even the simplest organs," so rudimentary means basic. The word begins like "rude," but it has nothing to do with manners here.$q$, 'draft', 'fecbe175-7fa7-5b78-9537-bfdb8012095e')
