   $q$Based on the final paragraph, what can be inferred about Lindqvist's recommendation for Penhallow Creek?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Lindqvist believes the nearby road should be moved before any of the Penhallow gates are opened.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Lindqvist intends a gradual opening to limit the risk that strong tidal flows will cut channels near the road.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Lindqvist doubts that the Penhallow meadow can be restored and wants to delay the decision indefinitely.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Lindqvist expects the Penhallow meadow to rebuild faster than Harrowford did because it sits lower.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Lindqvist intends a gradual opening to limit the risk that strong tidal flows will cut channels near the road.$q$, $q$Engineers fear that opening the deeper meadow "all at once" could scour channels that undermine the road, and Lindqvist answers by recommending stages plus storm inspections. Lindqvist proposes opening the gates, so the claim of doubt about restoration contradicts the text.$q$, 'draft', '3ff382a5-a9f8-573d-b837-4003a3af3d49')
