-- Passage rg12-literary-structure-pov-p01
insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('4ea542ed-e248-5aee-8d85-3b5eaf814e77', 'rg12-literary-structure-pov-p01', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g12-literary-structure-pov'), null,
        '9-12', $q$An Exciting Update for Your Kettle$q$, $q$Dear Valued Owner,

Congratulations! Your SmartBoil kettle has received an update that makes boiling water more personal, more secure, and more meaningful than ever before.

In the past, owners simply filled the kettle, pressed a button, and waited for hot water. Our research team found this process troubling. It left no record of who boiled what, when, or why, and it gave owners almost no opportunity to share their feelings about the experience.

Starting today, the kettle will greet you by name before each use. It will then ask you to confirm your identity with a six-digit code sent to your phone, which you will need to locate, unlock, and carry back to the kitchen. Once you are verified, the kettle will offer three boiling plans. The Basic Plan heats water to a temperature we describe as "warm, in spirit." The Plus Plan reaches a full boil on weekdays. The Premium Plan, available for a small monthly fee, includes weekends.

We have also listened to your concerns about speed. Many owners told us their kettle took four minutes to boil. We are pleased to report that, thanks to the new verification steps, the kettle now takes only four minutes after the eleven minutes of setup.

Finally, after every cup, the kettle will invite you to rate your water from one to five stars. Owners who skip the survey will be reminded, gently and repeatedly, until a rating is received.

We know you could have chosen any kettle. We are grateful you chose one that can no longer be returned.

Warmly,
The SmartBoil Customer Delight Team$q$, 'draft')
