  ('8388195a-adc4-5831-98ad-34d510d918e6', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g12-literary-structure-pov'), null, 'medium',
   $q$The letter says the kettle "now takes only four minutes after the eleven minutes of setup." What is the effect of this sentence?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It explains why setup is needed, so readers can see the security benefits clearly.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"It admits the company made a mistake, so the letter turns into a sincere apology.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misses-irony"},{"text":"It presents a slower process as a solution, so the company's own wording exposes the problem.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It proves the update made boiling faster, so the owners' complaints were answered.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"takes-speaker-literally"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It presents a slower process as a solution, so the company's own wording exposes the problem.$q$, $q$The company frames the timing as good news, yet four minutes plus eleven minutes of setup is far slower than before. The letter never apologizes; its cheerful tone continues to the end.$q$, 'draft', '4ea542ed-e248-5aee-8d85-3b5eaf814e77')
