   $q$How does the final paragraph relate the specific history of Merrow to a broader idea?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It repeats the timeline of events so the reader can memorize the order in which they happened.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-structure"},{"text":"It argues that businesses should never be allowed to influence how a community measures time.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"},{"text":"It treats the Merrow story as an example of how new technology can reshape habits that once seemed natural.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It suggests that Merrow should restore local sun time now that fewer people travel by train.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It treats the Merrow story as an example of how new technology can reshape habits that once seemed natural.$q$, $q$The final paragraph begins "The episode shows how a new technology can quietly reshape habits," generalizing beyond Merrow. The view that businesses should not influence time belongs to the objectors in paragraph 4, not to the author.$q$, 'draft', '1bd1fd44-46a0-568c-8fbe-05daf0e93544')
